        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer - Register now at SherryFitz.ieSherry FitzGerald Farrell is delighted to bring to the market this attractive land holding comprising circa 4.7hectares/11.65acres of farm land together with established forestry plantation with the benefit of extensive frontage onto the River Shannon.This valuable property is located just north of Carrick-on-Shannon and close to Leitrim Village and is adjacent to the proposed Carrick-on-Shannon to Battle bridge Shannon Blueway extension.This property would be an unparalleled location for a private camping/glamping business or myriad other uses, subject to obtaining necessary planning permission."
